# Area: tab.
# Rationale: expose per-tab media/mute, favicon PNGs, security events, isolated
#   scoped document-start/end scripts and CSS, trusted shift-click link peek,
#   and bounded viewport/full-page capture without Browser or renderer patches.
# Last-Rebased: 2026-11-02 (Chromium 156.0.8078.74).
# Frozen-file exceptions: core ABI adds services declarations/capability routing
